	(text "MOTORS - DShot600 on TIM3 (AF2)\nBetaflight order, top view, front up:\n  M1 = rear right    PB4  TIM3_CH1  DMA1 S4\n  M2 = front right   PB5  TIM3_CH2  DMA1 S5\n  M3 = rear left     PB0  TIM3_CH3  DMA1 S7\n  M4 = front left    PB1  TIM3_CH4  DMA1 S2\n  DMA1 channel 5 (RM0090 Rev 22, Table 43)\n\n220R series resistor: limits a short to GND to 15 mA\n(max. 25 mA per pin, DS8626 Rev 12, Table 12).\n\nPB4 = NJTRST: internal pull-up after reset\n(RM0090 Rev 22, Section 8.3.1). Configure TIM3 early.\n\nConnector = solder pads, not a component:\nexclude from BOM and position files.\n\nOptional 10k pull-downs (DNP): fit only if an ESC reacts to the PB4 reset pull-up.\nValue is a design choice, not from datasheet."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 99.568 69.85 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "0a5ec668-3c12-412d-b1e9-d9a40c1d3d2a")
	)
